Began playing in the early day, '''LethalWiz''' co-founded Swedish [[The Outcasts Clan]] in 1996. After a year with various success they switched direction to [[Capture the Flag]], and became [[The Millenium Outcasts]]. Fighting through tough opposition, they achieved 2nd place in [[Swedish CTF-championships -98|Swedish CTF-championships]] in 1998.

From 1999 LethalWiz took a 7 year hiatus to explore other games (such as CS and Battlefield), only to return in 2006 with [[JÃ¤garna|Jägarna]] where the hunt for glory days was on. After years of harrow, he found home with [[Suddendeath]], both ingame and outside of it.

In more recent years, LethalWiz has been a well known voice as caster, sometimes thrown in as sidekick at various events. 

